<title>HONG KONG: Kredietbank HK places HK$ fixed rate CD.</title>
<headline>Kredietbank HK places HK$ fixed rate CD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kredietbank, acting through its Hong Kong branch, has lodged a HK$110 million fixed rate certificates of deposit issue due January 29, 2001 with the Hong Kong Monetary Authority Central Moneymarkets Unit.</p>
<p>The issue was priced at par and pays a coupon of 7.15 percent.</p>
<p>Hongkong and Shanghai Banking Corp was the arranger.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
